'verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja521:47.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja521:47.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja521:47.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja521:48.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja521:48.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja521:48.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja521:48.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja521:49.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja521:49.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja521:49.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja521:49.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja521:50.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja521:50.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja521:50.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja521:50.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja521:51.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja521:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja521:0.2": "Cattālīsanipāta ", "ja521:0.3": "Tesakuṇavagga ", "ja521:0.4": "1. Tesakuṇajātaka ", "ja521:1.1": "Namo tassa Bhagavato Arahato Sammāsambuddhassa. ", "ja521:2.1": "“Vessantaraṁ taṁ pucchāmi, ", "ja521:2.2": "sakuṇa bhaddamatthu te; ", "ja521:2.3": "Rajjaṁ kāretukāmena, ", "ja521:2.4": "kiṁ su kiccaṁ kataṁ varaṁ”. ", "ja521:3.1": "“Cirassaṁ vata maṁ tāto, ", "ja521:3.2": "kaṁso bārāṇasiggaho; ", "ja521:3.3": "Pamatto appamattaṁ maṁ, ", "ja521:3.4": "pitā puttaṁ acodayi. ", "ja521:4.1": "Paṭhameneva vitathaṁ, ", "ja521:4.2": "kodhaṁ hāsaṁ nivāraye; ", "ja521:4.3": "Tato kiccāni kāreyya, ", "ja521:4.4": "taṁ vataṁ āhu khattiya. ", "ja521:5.1": "Yaṁ tvaṁ tāta tapokammaṁ, ", "ja521:5.2": "Pubbe katamasaṁsayaṁ; ", "ja521:5.3": "Ratto duṭṭho ca yaṁ kayirā, ", "ja521:5.4": "Na taṁ kayirā tato puna. ", "ja521:6.1": "Khattiyassa pamattassa, ", "ja521:6.2": "raṭṭhasmiṁ raṭṭhavaḍḍhana; ", "ja521:6.3": "Sabbe bhogā vinassanti, ", "ja521:6.4": "rañño taṁ vuccate aghaṁ. ", "ja521:7.1": "Sirī tāta alakkhī ca, ", "ja521:7.2": "pucchitā etadabravuṁ; ", "ja521:7.3": "Uṭṭhānavīriye pose, ", "ja521:7.4": "ramāhaṁ anusūyake. ", "ja521:8.1": "Usūyake duhadaye, ", "ja521:8.2": "purise kammadussake; ", "ja521:8.3": "Kāḷakaṇṇī mahārāja, ", "ja521:8.4": "ramati cakkabhañjanī. ", "ja521:9.1": "So tvaṁ sabbesu suhadayo, ", "ja521:9.2": "sabbesaṁ rakkhito bhava; ", "ja521:9.3": "Alakkhiṁ nuda mahārāja, ", "ja521:9.4": "lakkhyā bhava nivesanaṁ. ", "ja521:10.1": "Sa lakkhīdhitisampanno, ", "ja521:10.2": "puriso hi mahaggato; ", "ja521:10.3": "Amittānaṁ kāsipati, ", "ja521:10.4": "mūlaṁ aggañca chindati. ", "ja521:11.1": "Sakkopi hi bhūtapati, ", "ja521:11.2": "uṭṭhāne nappamajjati; ", "ja521:11.3": "Sa kalyāṇe dhitiṁ katvā, ", "ja521:11.4": "uṭṭhāne kurute mano. ", "ja521:12.1": "Gandhabbā pitaro devā, ", "ja521:12.2": "sājīvā honti tādino; ", "ja521:12.3": "Uṭṭhāhato appamajjato, ", "ja521:12.4": "anutiṭṭhanti devatā. ", "ja521:13.1": "So appamatto akkuddho, ", "ja521:13.2": "tāta kiccāni kāraya; ", "ja521:13.3": "Vāyamassu ca kiccesu, ", "ja521:13.4": "nālaso vindate sukhaṁ. ", "ja521:14.1": "Tattheva te vattapadā, ", "ja521:14.2": "esāva anusāsanī; ", "ja521:14.3": "Alaṁ mitte sukhāpetuṁ, ", "ja521:14.4": "amittānaṁ dukhāya ca”. ", "ja521:15.1": "“Sakkhisi tvaṁ kuṇḍalini, ", "ja521:15.2": "maññasi khattabandhuni; ", "ja521:15.3": "Rajjaṁ kāretukāmena, ", "ja521:15.4": "kiṁ su kiccaṁ kataṁ varaṁ”. ", "ja521:16.1": "“Dveva tāta padakāni, ", "ja521:16.2": "yattha sabbaṁ patiṭṭhitaṁ; ", "ja521:16.3": "Aladdhassa ca yo lābho, ", "ja521:16.4": "laddhassa cānurakkhaṇā. ", "ja521:17.1": "Amacce tāta jānāhi, ", "ja521:17.2": "dhīre atthassa kovide; ", "ja521:17.3": "Anakkhākitave tāta, ", "ja521:17.4": "asoṇḍe avināsake. ", "ja521:18.1": "Yo ca taṁ tāta rakkheyya, ", "ja521:18.2": "dhanaṁ yañceva te siyā; ", "ja521:18.3": "Sūtova rathaṁ saṅgaṇhe, ", "ja521:18.4": "so te kiccāni kāraye. ", "ja521:19.1": "Susaṅgahitantajano, ", "ja521:19.2": "sayaṁ vittaṁ avekkhiya; ", "ja521:19.3": "Nidhiñca iṇadānañca, ", "ja521:19.4": "na kare parapattiyā. ", "ja521:20.1": "Sayaṁ āyaṁ vayaṁ jaññā, ", "ja521:20.2": "sayaṁ jaññā katākataṁ; ", "ja521:20.3": "Niggaṇhe niggahārahaṁ, ", "ja521:20.4": "paggaṇhe paggahārahaṁ. ", "ja521:21.1": "Sayaṁ jānapadaṁ atthaṁ, ", "ja521:21.2": "anusāsa rathesabha; ", "ja521:21.3": "Mā te adhammikā yuttā, ", "ja521:21.4": "dhanaṁ raṭṭhañca nāsayuṁ. ", "ja521:22.1": "Mā ca vegena kiccāni, ", "ja521:22.2": "karosi kārayesi vā; ", "ja521:22.3": "Vegasā hi kataṁ kammaṁ, ", "ja521:22.4": "mando pacchānutappati. ", "ja521:23.1": "Mā te adhisare muñca, ", "ja521:23.2": "subāḷhamadhikopitaṁ; ", "ja521:23.3": "Kodhasā hi bahū phītā, ", "ja521:23.4": "kulā akulataṁ gatā. ", "ja521:24.1": "Mā tāta issaromhīti, ", "ja521:24.2": "anatthāya patārayi; ", "ja521:24.3": "Itthīnaṁ purisānañca, ", "ja521:24.4": "mā te āsi dukhudrayo. ", "ja521:25.1": "Apetalomahaṁsassa, ", "ja521:25.2": "rañño kāmānusārino; ", "ja521:25.3": "Sabbe bhogā vinassanti, ", "ja521:25.4": "rañño taṁ vuccate aghaṁ. ", "ja521:26.1": "Tattheva te vattapadā, ", "ja521:26.2": "esāva anusāsanī; ", "ja521:26.3": "Dakkhassudāni puññakaro, ", "ja521:26.4": "asoṇḍo avināsako; ", "ja521:26.5": "Sīlavāssu mahārāja, ", "ja521:26.6": "dussīlo vinipātiko”. ", "ja521:27.1": "“Apucchimha kosiyagottaṁ, ", "ja521:27.2": "kuṇḍaliniṁ tatheva ca; ", "ja521:27.3": "Tvaṁ dāni vadehi jambuka, ", "ja521:27.4": "balānaṁ balamuttamaṁ”. ", "ja521:28.1": "“Balaṁ pañcavidhaṁ loke, ", "ja521:28.2": "purisasmiṁ mahaggate; ", "ja521:28.3": "Tattha bāhubalaṁ nāma, ", "ja521:28.4": "carimaṁ vuccate balaṁ. ", "ja521:29.1": "Bhogabalañca dīghāvu, ", "ja521:29.2": "dutiyaṁ vuccate balaṁ; ", "ja521:29.3": "Amaccabalañca dīghāvu, ", "ja521:29.4": "tatiyaṁ vuccate balaṁ. ", "ja521:30.1": "Abhijaccabalaṁ ceva, ", "ja521:30.2": "taṁ catutthaṁ asaṁsayaṁ; ", "ja521:30.3": "Yāni cetāni sabbāni, ", "ja521:30.4": "adhigaṇhāti paṇḍito. ", "ja521:31.1": "Taṁ balānaṁ balaṁ seṭṭhaṁ, ", "ja521:31.2": "aggaṁ paññābalaṁ balaṁ; ", "ja521:31.3": "Paññābalenupatthaddho, ", "ja521:31.4": "atthaṁ vindati paṇḍito. ", "ja521:32.1": "Api ce labhati mando, ", "ja521:32.2": "phītaṁ dharaṇimuttamaṁ; ", "ja521:32.3": "Akāmassa pasayhaṁ vā, ", "ja521:32.4": "añño taṁ paṭipajjati. ", "ja521:33.1": "Abhijātopi ce hoti, ", "ja521:33.2": "rajjaṁ laddhāna khattiyo; ", "ja521:33.3": "Duppañño hi kāsipati, ", "ja521:33.4": "sabbenapi na jīvati. ", "ja521:34.1": "Paññāva sutaṁ vinicchinī, ", "ja521:34.2": "Paññā kitti silokavaḍḍhanī; ", "ja521:34.3": "Paññāsahito naro idha, ", "ja521:34.4": "Api dukkhe sukhāni vindati. ", "ja521:35.1": "Paññañca kho asussūsaṁ, ", "ja521:35.2": "na koci adhigacchati; ", "ja521:35.3": "Bahussutaṁ anāgamma, ", "ja521:35.4": "dhammaṭṭhaṁ avinibbhujaṁ. ", "ja521:36.1": "Yo ca dhammavibhaṅgaññū, ", "ja521:36.2": "kāluṭṭhāyī matandito; ", "ja521:36.3": "Anuṭṭhahati kālena, ", "ja521:36.4": "kammaphalaṁ tassijjhati. ", "ja521:37.1": "Anāyatanasīlassa, ", "ja521:37.2": "anāyatanasevino; ", "ja521:37.3": "Na nibbindiyakārissa, ", "ja521:37.4": "sammadattho vipaccati. ", "ja521:38.1": "Ajjhattañca payuttassa, ", "ja521:38.2": "tathāyatanasevino; ", "ja521:38.3": "Anibbindiyakārissa, ", "ja521:38.4": "sammadattho vipaccati. ", "ja521:39.1": "Yogappayogasaṅkhātaṁ, ", "ja521:39.2": "sambhatassānurakkhaṇaṁ; ", "ja521:39.3": "Tāni tvaṁ tāta sevassu, ", "ja521:39.4": "mā akammāya randhayi; ", "ja521:39.5": "Akammunā hi dummedho, ", "ja521:39.6": "naḷāgāraṁva sīdati”. ", "ja521:40.1": "“Dhammaṁ cara mahārāja, ", "ja521:40.2": "mātāpitūsu khattiya; ", "ja521:40.3": "Idha dhammaṁ caritvāna, ", "ja521:40.4": "rāja saggaṁ gamissasi. ", "ja521:41.1": "Dhammaṁ cara mahārāja, ", "ja521:41.2": "puttadāresu khattiya; ", "ja521:41.3": "Idha dhammaṁ caritvāna, ", "ja521:41.4": "rāja saggaṁ gamissasi. ", "ja521:42.1": "Dhammaṁ cara mahārāja, ", "ja521:42.2": "mittāmaccesu khattiya; ", "ja521:42.3": "Idha dhammaṁ caritvāna, ", "ja521:42.4": "rāja saggaṁ gamissasi. ", "ja521:43.1": "Dhammaṁ cara mahārāja, ", "ja521:43.2": "vāhanesu balesu ca; ", "ja521:43.3": "Idha dhammaṁ caritvāna, ", "ja521:43.4": "rāja saggaṁ gamissasi. ", "ja521:44.1": "Dhammaṁ cara mahārāja, ", "ja521:44.2": "gāmesu nigamesu ca; ", "ja521:44.3": "…pe… ", "ja521:45.1": "Dhammaṁ cara mahārāja, ", "ja521:45.2": "raṭṭhesu janapadesu ca; ", "ja521:45.3": "…pe… ", "ja521:46.1": "Dhammaṁ cara mahārāja, ", "ja521:46.2": "samaṇabrāhmaṇesu ca; ", "ja521:46.3": "…pe… ", "ja521:47.1": "Dhammaṁ cara mahārāja, ", "ja521:47.2": "migapakkhīsu khattiya; ", "ja521:47.3": "Idha dhammaṁ caritvāna, ", "ja521:47.4": "rāja saggaṁ gamissasi. ", "ja521:48.1": "Dhammaṁ cara mahārāja, ", "ja521:48.2": "dhammo ciṇṇo sukhāvaho; ", "ja521:48.3": "Idha dhammaṁ caritvāna, ", "ja521:48.4": "rāja saggaṁ gamissasi. ", "ja521:49.1": "Dhammaṁ cara mahārāja, ", "ja521:49.2": "Saindā devā sabrahmakā; ", "ja521:49.3": "Suciṇṇena divaṁ pattā, ", "ja521:49.4": "Mā dhammaṁ rāja pāmado. ", "ja521:50.1": "Tattheva te vattapadā, ", "ja521:50.2": "Esāva anusāsanī; ", "ja521:50.3": "Sappaññasevī kalyāṇī, ", "ja521:50.4": "Samattaṁ sāma taṁ vidū”ti. ", "ja521:51.1": "Tesakuṇajātakaṁ paṭhamaṁ. "}, "variant_text": {"ja521:0.1": "", "ja521:0.2": "", "ja521:0.3": "", "ja521:0.4": "", "ja521:1.1": "", "ja521:2.1": "", "ja521:2.2": "te → vete (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja521:2.3": "", "ja521:2.4": "", "ja521:3.1": "", "ja521:3.2": "", "ja521:3.3": "", "ja521:3.4": "", "ja521:4.1": "", "ja521:4.2": "", "ja521:4.3": "", "ja521:4.4": "", "ja521:5.1": "tapokammaṁ → tape kammaṁ (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja521:5.2": "", "ja521:5.3": "", "ja521:5.4": "puna → punaṁ (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja521:6.1": "", "ja521:6.2": "", "ja521:6.3": "", "ja521:6.4": "", "ja521:7.1": "tāta alakkhī ca → sirī ca tāta lakkhī ca (sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja521:7.2": "", "ja521:7.3": "Uṭṭhānavīriye → uṭṭhāne vīriye (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja521:7.4": "", "ja521:8.1": "", "ja521:8.2": "", "ja521:8.3": "", "ja521:8.4": "ramati → ramāti (mr) ", "ja521:9.1": "tvaṁ sabbesu suhadayo → so tvaṁ sabbesaṁ suhadayo (sya1ed, sya2ed, pt